# el11 (2026-10-25): periodic passes (every n presents) instead of removing them, so the picture stays whole.
measure 60
r0 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on
r0-every2 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 2;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps
r0-every3 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 3;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps
base-1 60
r0-p2every2 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 2;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q0|Frame/Proxy Set Fill Streams;;passx q0|Frame/Lighting/CS Lights;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q50|Generate high-res terrain instances;;passx q50|Generate Terrain Index Buffers;;passx q0|Frame/CS Mesh;;passx q0|Frame/Displacement;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Clipmap Update;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Deformation Update
r0-p2every3 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 3;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q0|Frame/Proxy Set Fill Streams;;passx q0|Frame/Lighting/CS Lights;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q50|Generate high-res terrain instances;;passx q50|Generate Terrain Index Buffers;;passx q0|Frame/CS Mesh;;passx q0|Frame/Displacement;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Clipmap Update;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Deformation Update
all-every3 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 3;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q0|Frame/Proxy Set Fill Streams;;passx q0|Frame/Lighting/CS Lights;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q50|Generate high-res terrain instances;;passx q50|Generate Terrain Index Buffers;;passx q0|Frame/CS Mesh;;passx q0|Frame/Displacement;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Clipmap Update;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Deformation Update
all-every4 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 4;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q0|Frame/Proxy Set Fill Streams;;passx q0|Frame/Lighting/CS Lights;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q50|Generate high-res terrain instances;;passx q50|Generate Terrain Index Buffers;;passx q0|Frame/CS Mesh;;passx q0|Frame/Displacement;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Clipmap Update;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Deformation Update
base-2 60
r0-p2every4 60 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 4;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q0|Frame/Proxy Set Fill Streams;;passx q0|Frame/Lighting/CS Lights;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q50|Generate high-res terrain instances;;passx q50|Generate Terrain Index Buffers;;passx q0|Frame/CS Mesh;;passx q0|Frame/Displacement;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Clipmap Update;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Deformation Update
all-every6 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;every 6;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q0|Frame/Proxy Set Fill Streams;;passx q0|Frame/Lighting/CS Lights;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q50|Generate high-res terrain instances;;passx q50|Generate Terrain Index Buffers;;passx q0|Frame/CS Mesh;;passx q0|Frame/Displacement;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Clipmap Update;;passx q0|Frame/Terrain Deformation Update
base-3 60
